<title>HONG KONG: China approves HK-Japan air services agreement.</title>
<headline>China approves HK-Japan air services agreement.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>China has approved the air services agreement between Hong Kong and Japan, the Britsh representative to the Sino-British Joint Liaison Group (JLG) on Hong Kong said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The JLG reached agreement on the initialled text of the agreement on Wednesday and authorised the Hong Kong government to formally sign it with its Japanese counterpart, it said.</p>
<p>Beijing's approval was needed as the accord straddles the British colony's return to Chinese sovereignty next year. The JLG is the diplomatic body handling the transition.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
